# A backstop, not the control. No key material is kept here in any form, encrypted or
# otherwise (DESIGN.md §5) — these patterns exist to catch a file that lands in the
# source directory by accident, and a repository whose safety rests on a pattern list
# is one filename away from a leak.

# keys and certificates
*.key
*.pem
*.gpg
*.p12
*.pfx
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*

# age private keys
*age*key*
key.txt

# environment and credentials
.env
.env.*
*.env
.netrc
.npmrc
.pgpass

# chezmoi's own state and local configuration: outside the source directory by
# design, listed in case a stray copy appears inside it
*.boltdb
chezmoi.toml
